{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/RXYVjYTZCCUkjvpmP6LiOg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:14.559197+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/RXYVjYTZCCUkjvpmP6LiOg","html":"<div><p><strong><span><span>江南大学</span><span></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>智能与合成食品发酵研究中心</span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span><span>2027级</span></span><span>推免硕士研究生招生</span></span></strong></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/OptCabptYDEHPAKKnDExjcOSW75eiavZ4ZMBfazJF6TwQicOI6Hhwl14gjhvhq9Iv0c7H5hWLuzjlRo4thMmEMIJqOUDDwFUElpicJA1cIGicU8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>✨</span></span><b><span><span>以合成生物学赋能食品发酵，面向未来食品与绿色生物制造，期待优秀学子加入</span><span></span></span></b></p><p><strong><span><span>一、</span></span></strong><strong><span>研究室简介</span></strong></p><p><b><span><span>智能与合成食品发酵研究室</span></span></b><span><span>，依托江南大学</span><b><span>生物工程、食品科学与工程、轻工技术与工程</span></b><span>优势一流学科，聚焦发酵工程、生物催化、合成生物学与计算生物学前沿方向。针对发酵工程领域关键科学与技术难题，解析核心微生物、酶的代谢互作机制，面向未来解决发酵食品、功能化合物制造过程中的安全、风味、功能组分等核心问题，打通基础研究到工程化落地链条，助力我国发酵产业技术升级。</span></span></p><p><span><span>研究室负责人简介</span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/OptCabptYDFo3qw5dtaBmKOQwG9J4NcLnx6BrRPdyT8pyugRlyO2pibcum6LnTIjPaGp4xSiaWfCHOJP1tRaYpuqKxo1BZK7c8lBspQcQZfzw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>夏小乐，教授，博士生导师。神农青年英才，国家重点研发计划项目首席，中国微生物协会二级分会专家委员会副主任委员、中国发酵工业协会技术委员会委员、中国科协发酵食品专家咨询团队首席专家，中国农学会农产品贮藏加工分会常务委员等，主要从事微生物发酵工程的研究与教学工作。作为负责人先后负责国家重点研发计划、国家自然科学基金、中国工程院战略咨询项目等</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>余项。在</span></span><span><span>Nat. Commun.‌</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>Adv. Sci</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>ISME J</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>Trends Food Sci Technol</span></span><span><span>等国内外生物工程类主流学术期刊上发表学术论文</span></span><span><span>80</span></span><span><span>余篇、授权发明专利</span></span><span><span>60</span></span><span><span>余项、美国专利</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>项、出版专著（或教材）</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>部。研究成果获中国商业联合会科技进步特等奖（第一）、中国轻工业联合会科技进步奖一等奖（第一）和教育部科技进步二等奖（第二）等奖项</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>项。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span>招生</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>专业</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span>学术型硕士</span>：</span></span><strong><span><span>发酵工程（082203）、微生物学（071005）、生物化学与分子生物学（071010）</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span>专业型硕士</span>：</span><span>生物技术与工程（086001）</span></span><strong><span><span>、发酵工程（086004）</span></span></strong></p><p><b><span><span>博士</span></span></b><span><span>优先招收有食品科学、发酵工程、代谢工程、生物催化、微生物学等相关领域科研经历的申请者。</span></span></p><p><span>二、团队</span><span>组</span><span>成</span></p><p><span><span>高玲</span></span><strong><span><span><span>-博士，</span></span><span>助理研究员，硕士生导师</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/OptCabptYDECrdugBs3vXxpYvnMcQ3bVrc9EsbmzlSnNq2OmSDibIemlOasIeCOKdjTjLGUK4IMwTo37s0nBTF3T1lib5kPuV594jBPh2avGA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span><span>廖辉-博士，</span></span><span>助理研究员</span></span></strong></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/OptCabptYDHOAr6p4lCQmcry4HQh8wibaiaPbwDTeSjtGzYzCm6w0tXI9o5vhFbl8vNNoibKYQruA9VOWanibY2rgo5NNJ7cbYGnDWswEs4gyjs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><strong><span><span>徐文照-博士，助理研究员</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/OptCabptYDFVJr0PrrCicfiayjaTeNBk0psgrOk5prQWwGAnKV63pRoJOyPaYGkibokGCLupvBdvE493g0jj51QG9xicpgb6UBAHo6pYyHvTpxw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></span></p><p><span><span>三、研究方向</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>(1)AI辅助</span></span></span><span><span><span>未来发酵食品绿色智能制造</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>基于进化生物学、计算生物学和生化反应动力学等技术和手段，对传统发酵食品如酿酒大曲、黄酒、辣椒酱、豆瓣酱等的核心微生物进行识别、代谢进化挖掘、时空互作分析、动力学建模、定向重构以及智能控制系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span><span><span>平台设计与构建，以期解决工业规模中食品安全、功能强化等问题，实现发酵食品定向设计与智能化制造。</span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bm3K5OIJibGCXTiarPlSxbw9BcSd8ILMW4sGicAm1f7lqweZrcnJF7o8FKRYm9bgib1gTNJ5JeQrb17IAt9iaRxby9g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span><span>(2)AI加速</span></span></span><span><span>健康功能因子的合成生物制造</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>针对健康相关活性大分子，如脂肽、维生素、发酵膳食纤维等，通过合成生物学与计算生物学等手段，开发基于深度学习的合成调控工具和新型酶工程改造策略，实现功能因子的高效合成和高性能工业酶制剂的应用生产，赋能生命健康和食品酿造领域。</span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bm3K5OIJibGCXTiarPlSxbw9BcSd8ILMW47cYC5c1nMd4EvuPPJibRTqcLIZhLKUz3Cdiaric9icjAu21er3ExS9FLsQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span>四、研究成果丰富</span></p><p><span><span>在</span></span><span><span>Nature Communications</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>Advanced Science</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>Chemical Engineering Journal</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>Trends in Food Science &amp; Technology</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>Biosensor Bioelectronics</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>Food Hydrocolloids</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>Biotechnology Advances</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>Food chemistry</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>Bioresource Technology</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>Journal of Agricultural and Food Chemistry</span></span><span><span>等国际主流期刊上发表</span></span><span><span>SCI</span></span><span><span>论文</span></span><span><span>80</span></span><span><span>余篇，出版专著（或教材）</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>部，申请或授权发明专利</span></span><span><span>60</span></span><span><span>余项，美国专利</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>项。</span></span></p><p><span><span>研究成果获中国商业联合会科技进步特等奖（排</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>），中国轻工业联合会科技进步奖一等奖（排</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）和教育部科技进步二等奖（排</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）；课题组目前承担包括国家重点研发计划、国家自然科学基金、中国工程院战略咨询项目和龙头企业横向项目在内等</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>多项，年均科研经费超</span></span><span><span>260</span></span><span><span>万元。</span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OptCabptYDFotLrH7Uia27z3jkQbhqXfVR3k4SBPr5m5RiadxUmQ7n67zlvO0nsJDO8bqDNODPiabNHegM2icOpP1L7DjbHvO1mGhHWLNYL9TNM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><strong><span><span>五、高水平人才培养</span></span></strong></p><ul><li><p><b><span><span><span>系列培训</span></span></span></b></p></li></ul><p><span><span>①</span></span><span><span> </span></span><span><span>科研入门篇</span></span></p><p><span><span>实验室设备使用培训：</span></span></p><p><span><span>高效液相</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>气相色谱仪、</span></span><span><span>PCR</span></span><span><span>仪、多功能酶标仪、发酵罐、冷冻干燥机等。</span></span></p><p><span><span>数据库使用培训：</span></span></p><p><span><span>数据库包括</span></span><span><span>NCBI</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>KEGG</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>Uniprot</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>BRENDA</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>PDB</span></span><span><span>等。</span></span></p><p><span><span>②</span></span><span><span> </span></span><span><span>科研提高篇</span></span></p><p><span><span>a</span></span><span><span>）高年级师兄师姐悉心指导，培养独立实验操作技能，打好科研基础；</span></span></p><p><span><span>b</span></span><span><span>）定期组织文献阅读和学术交流会，掌握文献追踪、阅读能力，了解科研动态，提高科研素养；</span></span></p><p><span><span>c</span></span><span><span>）导师亲自指导和全程把握课题方向和内容，加强科研工作效率。</span></span></p><p><span><span>③</span></span><span><span> </span></span><span><span>科研升华篇</span></span></p><p><span><span> a</span></span><span><span>）高质量论文撰写培训：内容的提炼、以及论文标题、摘要、结果、前言和讨论的撰写；</span></span></p><p><span><span> b</span></span><span><span>）导师指导论文写作：论文框架，结果、前言和讨论部分凝练与修改；</span></span></p><p><span><span> c</span></span><span><span>）实验室优秀毕业生工作经验分享，答疑解惑。</span></span></p><p><span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bm3K5OIJibGCcmrjc1rKm2LvvzLaoiaEh0Cyhx9VpHTCMTGib5dCsT3vu51VVtWLwEC3Vav6H6iadbJ78zIAGTQmHQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></span></p><p><span><span>④ 校企联培篇</span></span></p><p><span><span>a) 通过工程硕博士改革专项、卓越工程师培养等项目与知名企业联合培养，培养真题真解，实践应用能力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>b) 企业提供科研项目场地设备、生活津贴、员工待遇食宿等优渥条件，优秀者可推免直博，亦可优先入职联培企业。</span></span></p><ul><li><p><b><span><span><span>学术交流</span></span></span></b></p></li></ul><p><span><span>研究室每年都会根据研究生的研究方向，邀请国内或国外的专家课题组进行学术研讨交流；同时也会参加国内学术年会和国际学术会议</span></span><span><span>3-5</span></span><span><span>人次；除此之外，研究室还与哈佛大学、马里兰大学等国外知名高校建立了长期友好的合作，支持海外留学三月以上，帮助师生拓宽视野，深入了解学科前沿进展。</span></span></p><ul><li><p><b><span><span><span>培养成绩</span></span></span></b></p></li></ul><p><b><span><span>研究室重视研究生科研能力培养，研究生以第一作者在本领域国际</span></span></b><span><span> TOP </span></span><span><span>期刊发表高水平</span></span><span><span>SCI</span></span><span><span>论文，代表性成果如下。</span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/OptCabptYDEichUTm7SprBHdEEaI1xicR9wOhxS3hflkZvxFjZFibP9TEk1Fl0GibibjX5pDztm5ukv9wicHvesFAib6ZE6E1WZoWypqczcACX6KnM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><section><span>六、满意的</span><span>就业情</span><span>况</span></section><p><span><span>研究室自成立以来，已毕业博士研究生</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>名，硕士研究生</span></span><span><span>51</span></span><span><span>名；现有在读博士研究生</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>名，硕士研究生</span></span><span><span>35</span></span><span><span>名。已培养研究生中，</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>名博士毕业生均进入一本高校；</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>人次获得江苏省创新计划资助、国家奖学金、江南大学优秀博士毕业论文、江南大学优秀硕士毕业论文；硕士研究生申请免试直博，录取率</span></span><span><span>100%</span></span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>名硕士毕业生升学至澳门科技大学、复旦大学、上海交通大学等国内外顶尖高校；</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>名硕士毕业生考上公务员或事业编；多名硕士毕业生就业于泸州老窖、</span></span><span><span>DSM</span></span><span><span>、养生堂、海天味业、常州药物研究所、药明生物、金枫酒业等国内知名企业。部分硕士研究生去向如下。</span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/OptCabptYDEedHzWONibYaejiaRX3DCictvEiaNRj5PsVXsFqN0PA5iaTSicN0ppaqUNL9bEUnMZXqU8XLbE2uzkSCJz74O8DlJOwS6LxP10dZ5fg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><p><strong><span><span>七、丰厚的</span></span></strong><strong><span>福利待遇</span></strong><span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）丰富的成果奖励</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>团队制定了《科研成果奖励制度》，对发表的</span></span><span><span>SCI</span></span><span><span>论文和申请的发明专利进行重金奖励。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>丰富的文娱活动</span></span></p><p><span><span>A</span></span><span><span>）休闲活动</span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bm3K5OIJibGCcmrjc1rKm2LvvzLaoiaEh0DVqY16D6Cxu5HV7Xf3YdskfLNlia3b2bawkCH5icfcUDgYmpfzia3KibOA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>B</span></span><span>）参加引领前沿的学术交流</span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bm3K5OIJibGCcmrjc1rKm2LvvzLaoiaEh0bzpKwEPp6nAqedIIH4EOcGSfftDRH9jFTicWCvp3xfuP6sal9fX99jQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>C</span></span><span>）贴心的生活服务</span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bm3K5OIJibGCcmrjc1rKm2LvvzLaoiaEh0AOxGibvv4bVT1saFm9eQAFVQHZNrItmmm4ibuialAbY74zr3GGFtKvDkw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span>不定期聚餐，火锅、烤肉、夜宵，吃遍江大东、南、北门，吃遍大无锡；烧烤装备齐全，任何季节，烧烤都是最爱；每周三的羽毛球等体育活动，强健体魄，身心得以放松；黄酒风味品评活动，趣味活动，可以到品尝各种黄酒；活动多多，等你发现，期待你的加入！</span></p><p><span>八、欢迎报名</span></p><section><span>江南大学从即日起接收2027年推免生预报名，获得就读本科高校推荐资格且有意申请免试攻读我校研究生的同学，请尽早登录“江南大学推荐免试研究生预报名系统”进行报名。</span></section><section><span>预报名系统网址：<span>http://yzgmis.jiangnan.edu.cn/zsgl/tmsgl/</span></span></section><section><span>截止时间：<span>2026年9月17日</span></span></section><p><span><br/></span><span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>联系方式</span></span></strong><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>地址：江苏省无锡市蠡湖大道</span></span><span><span><span>1800</span></span></span><span><span>号江南大学生物工程学院</span></span><span><span><span>B529</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>联系人：高老师</span></span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>电话：</span></span><span><span><span>15105165805</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>邮箱：</span></span><span><span><span>linggao@jiangnan.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>公众号：智能与合成食品发酵研究室</span></span></span></p><p></p></div>","textSha256":"4fca239037d71b84ce962d693aff4a03c0451048b392006c384916cd5ea64ef7","textLength":2851,"sourceSha256":"63deee214dbf3d009188154ffdb4caf37d9c179870af6daabe54c18fbfb38dca","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-bce7525357879d62bdc9","title":"2026年江南大学生物工程学院智能与合成食品发酵研究室接收2027级推免硕士研究生","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:14.559197+00:00"}
